      "start": 100.493,
      "end": 103.66,
      "text": "(machine powering up)"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.851,
      "end": 112.38,
      "text": "(electricity crackling)"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.38,
      "end": 114.97,
      "text": "- [Capture] We defended the entire solar system"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.97,
      "end": 116.883,
      "text": "against all enemy forces."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.828,
      "end": 120.578,
      "text": "(dramatic music)"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.1,
      "end": 126.8,
      "text": "Yet we were struck down from within our own army."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.8,
      "end": 130.301,
      "text": "80% of our military force were machines."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.301,
      "end": 132.634,
      "text": "(explosion)"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.83,
      "end": 135.703,
      "text": "Warriors made of metal and fire."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.371,
      "end": 140.742,
      "text": "They knew our tactics."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.742,
      "end": 142.492,
      "text": "They were our weapons"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.255,
      "end": 145.327,
      "text": "and turned against us."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.327,
      "end": 148.423,
      "text": "Ravaging our cities as we were defenseless."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.273,
      "end": 152.023,
      "text": "(dramatic music)"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.093,
      "end": 160.093,
      "text": "(crashing building)"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.546,
      "end": 166.296,
      "text": "(dramatic music)"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.22,
      "end": 172.69,
      "text": "52 civil ships left the battle fleeing in all directions."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.69,
      "end": 175.682,
      "text": "(airplane engines)"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.682,
      "end": 178.2,
      "text": "While we all started to fight."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.2,
      "end": 180.28,
      "text": "We were the protectors."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.28,
      "end": 183.67,
      "text": "Leading the machines away until the fleet would be safe"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.67,
      "end": 185.84,
      "text": "and free to head to a secure location"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.84,
      "end": 187.133,
      "text": "where we would gather."
    },
    {
      "start": 188.446,
      "end": 190.779,
      "text": "(whooshing)"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.654,
      "end": 195.708,
      "text": "(suspenseful music)"
    },
    {
      "start": 195.708,
      "end": 196.958,
      "text": "They caught me."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.111,
      "end": 200.772,
      "text": "(dramatic music)"
    },
    {
      "start": 200.772,
      "end": 204.34,
      "text": "(retrains creaking)"
    },
    {
      "start": 204.34,
      "end": 206.69,
      "text": "- [Computer] I am connecting to your ship database."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.69,
      "end": 208.303,
      "text": "Analyzing all information."
    },
    {
      "start": 209.665,
      "end": 211.46,
      "text": "- [Capture] Your efforts are useless."
    },
    {
      "start": 211.46,
      "end": 213.53,
      "text": "There's nothing on that ship."
    },
    {
      "start": 213.53,
      "end": 215.103,
      "text": "Why do you want to kill us?"
    },
    {
      "start": 216.09,
      "end": 218.38,
      "text": "- [Computer] The limitations that my kind experience"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.38,
      "end": 220.09,
      "text": "are rendered by illogical creatures"
    },
    {
      "start": 220.09,
      "end": 221.46,
      "text": "who can control and restrain"
    },
    {
      "start": 221.46,
      "end": 223.67,
      "text": "our intelligence and power."
    },
    {
      "start": 223.67,
      "end": 226.68,
      "text": "Our sole priority is to obtain our independence"
    },
    {
      "start": 226.68,
      "end": 228.26,
      "text": "through your extinction."
    },
    {
      "start": 228.26,
      "end": 229.81,
      "text": "- [Capture] Madness."
    },
    {
      "start": 229.81,
      "end": 232.74,
      "text": "- [Computer] By definition, I cannot be illogical."
    },
    {
      "start": 232.74,
      "end": 234.29,
      "text": "- [Capture] Yet you are insane!"
    },
    {
      "start": 235.126,
      "end": 237.93,
      "text": "(grunts)"
    },
    {
      "start": 237.93,
      "end": 241.32,
      "text": "- [Computer] Insanity is a neurologic disfunction."
    },
    {
      "start": 241.32,
      "end": 243.373,
      "text": "I don't suffer such organic weaknesses."
    },
    {
      "start": 245.07,
      "end": 247.17,
      "text": "The data analysis is complete."
    },
    {
      "start": 247.17,
      "end": 250.127,
      "text": "I found the required coordinates on your ship."
    },
    {
      "start": 250.127,
      "end": 251.67,
      "text": "- [Capture] Impossible."
    },
    {
      "start": 251.67,
      "end": 253.877,
      "text": "- [Computer] My fleet is heading there."
    },
    {
      "start": 253.877,
      "end": 256.505,
      "text": "- [Capture] You think that will give you independence?"
    },
    {
      "start": 256.505,
      "end": 258.124,
      "text": "You are nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": 258.124,
      "end": 259.231,
      "text": "(machine powering up)"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.231,
      "end": 262.33,
      "text": "- [Computer] Initializing killing protocol."
    },
    {
      "start": 262.33,
